# Orders API — sample requests (Visual Studio / VS Code REST Client).
#
# One-time local setup (keys are secrets: user-secrets, never the repo):
#   dotnet ef database update --project src/Services/Orders/Rota.Orders.Api
#   cd src/Services/Orders/Rota.Orders.Api
#   dotnet user-secrets set "Orders:DeliveryCodeHashKey"   "<base64 of 32 random bytes>"
#   dotnet user-secrets set "Orders:ResponseEncryptionKey" "<base64 of 32 random bytes>"
#   dotnet user-secrets set "Orders:TrackingSigningKey"    "<PKCS#8 PEM of an EC P-256 private key>"
# Generate in PowerShell:
#   [Convert]::ToBase64String([Security.Cryptography.RandomNumberGenerator]::GetBytes(32))
#   $k=[Security.Cryptography.ECDsa]::Create([Security.Cryptography.ECCurve+NamedCurves]::nistP256); $k.ExportPkcs8PrivateKeyPem()
#
# Auth until F08: X-Dev-User: merchant:<id> | courier:<guid> | dispatcher:<id> (Development only, ADR-006).

@host = http://localhost:5101
@merchant = merchant:merchant-demo

### Create an order (repeat with the same key: same response, still one order)
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-User: {{merchant}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{
  "merchantOrderRef": "PZ-2026-000123",
  "pickup":  { "lat": 40.9903, "lon": 29.0290, "address": "Kadıköy Şube, Moda Cd. 10" },
  "dropoff": { "lat": 40.9850, "lon": 29.0400, "address": "Caferağa Mh. Moda" },
  "customer": { "name": "Ayşe Y.", "phone": "+905551112233" }
}

### Same key, different body → 409 idempotency-key-reused
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-User: {{merchant}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-001

{
  "merchantOrderRef": "PZ-2026-000124",
  "pickup":  { "lat": 40.9903, "lon": 29.0290, "address": "Kadıköy Şube, Moda Cd. 10" },
  "dropoff": { "lat": 40.9850, "lon": 29.0400, "address": "Caferağa Mh. Moda" },
  "customer": { "name": "Ayşe Y.", "phone": "+905551112233" }
}

### Out of the 15 km service area → 422
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-User: {{merchant}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-key-ankara

{
  "merchantOrderRef": "PZ-2026-ANKARA",
  "pickup":  { "lat": 40.9903, "lon": 29.0290, "address": "Kadıköy" },
  "dropoff": { "lat": 39.9208, "lon": 32.8541, "address": "Kızılay, Ankara" },
  "customer": { "name": "Ayşe Y.", "phone": "+905551112233" }
}

### Get the order
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
X-Dev-User: {{merchant}}

### Another merchant asks for it → 404 (not 403: existence is not revealed)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
X-Dev-User: merchant:someone-else

### List, newest first (pass nextCursor as "after" for the next page)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders?limit=20
X-Dev-User: {{merchant}}

### Cancel (body optional)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders/{{create.response.body.$.id}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dev-User: {{merchant}}

{ "reason": "customer called" }

### Public key for tracking tokens (Ops API reads this)
GET {{host}}/.well-known/tracking-jwks
